-- ============================================================================
-- v1424: Seed / sample data — Plant, Equipment, Health & Safety registers (v1423) for the demo project
-- ============================================================================
-- Owner request 2026-11-11: sample data where it was missing, 10 records for each Plant, Equipment, Health & Safety register,
-- for SEED334-PRJ-08 (Construction & Engineering pack).
-- Fictional scenario for SEED334-PRJ-08: Velocity Freight builds its Northern Distribution Hub at Kestrel Park
-- (24,000 m² warehouse, 3-storey office block, 42-dock yard, access road, utilities), design and build by
-- the fictional Harbourline Construction Ltd. Site start 2 March 2026, practical completion 27 August 2027.
-- Dated around today (11 Nov 2026): steel frame complete, roof and cladding under way, slab and MEP starting.
-- Records: equipment 10, maintenance 10, hse_plan 10, risk_assessments 10, method_statements 10, toolbox_talks 10, safety_inspections 10, incidents 10, near_misses 10, hse_actions 10.
-- Vendor-neutral (rule 26), person fields are plain text. display_id is left blank so Admin ID
-- Generation assigns it (rule 16.2). Fixed hex-only ids …-4000-c124- … c12d- (ranges checked free
-- before use). ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING, and nothing is inserted if the project is missing.
-- Calculated values are worked out with the same rules as the app. The final query counts the
-- records per register, so a skipped insert is visible.
-- Prerequisites: v1423. Idempotent.
-- ============================================================================

